@startuml
autonumber
actor User
participant Frontend
participant Model
participant Backend

== LOAD FOLDER ==
User -> Frontend: Wants to load a dataset
Frontend -> Frontend: open_folder_dialog
Frontend -> Model: setData(role=LOAD_DATA_ROLE)
Model -> Backend: setDatasetPath( update dataset_path, and img_list)

== NEXT / PREVIOUS ==
User -> Frontend : Click Next, Previous, or enter an Index
Frontend -> Frontend : Segmentation2DPage.next_img() / previous_img()

Frontend -> Model : data(role = GET_INDEX_ROLE)
Model -> Backend : get_current_index()
Backend --> Model : return current index
Model --> Frontend : navigation_widget.set_index()

note over Frontend, Backend
  The masks are saved when the user presses 
  next or previous, directly in the folder. 
  The user can reload the folder.
end note

Frontend -> Model : save_mask()
Model -> Backend : save_mask()
Backend --> Model : OK

Frontend -> Model : setData(role=NEXT_IMG_ROLE)
Model -> Backend : next_image()
Backend --> Model : Return new image data
Model --> Frontend : Update view
@enduml